{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788460373707,"sessionID":"ses_f977bc931ffe9OHrIOJvOWQPwa","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-9f957fb600829813","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/src/check/mod.rs","newString":"/// Every function name the language itself provides, and therefore reserves. `str`, `range`,\n/// `chars`, and `i64` live in `builtin()`'s fixed table; `jsonlines`, `length`, `flatten`,\n/// `tail`, `collect`, `fields`, `sort`, `reverse`, `sum`, `max`, `first`, `any`, and `all` are\n/// polymorphic and checked from `synth`'s own arms; `select` and `map` rebind `.`. All nineteen\n/// are reserved the same way, and the docs harness (tests/docs.rs) reads this list to insist each\n/// one has a reference page.\npub const BUILTIN_NAMES: [&str; 19] = [\n    \"chars\",\n    \"collect\",\n    \"length\",\n    \"fields\",\n    \"flatten\",\n    \"i64\",\n    \"jsonlines\",\n    \"map\",\n    \"max\",\n    \"range\",\n    \"reverse\",\n    \"select\",\n    \"sort\",\n    \"str\",\n    \"sum\",\n    \"tail\",\n    \"first\",\n    \"any\",\n    \"all\",\n];","oldString":"/// Every function name the language itself provides, and therefore reserves. `str`, `range`,\n/// `chars`, and `i64` live in `builtin()`'s fixed table; `jsonlines`, `length`, `flatten`,\n/// `tail`, `collect`, `fields`, `sort`, `reverse`, `sum`, and `max` are polymorphic and checked\n/// from `synth`'s own arms; `select` and `map` rebind `.`. All sixteen are reserved the same\n/// way, and the docs harness (tests/docs.rs) reads this list to insist each one has a\n/// reference page.\npub const BUILTIN_NAMES: [&str; 16] = [\n    \"chars\",\n    \"collect\",\n    \"length\",\n    \"fields\",\n    \"flatten\",\n    \"i64\",\n    \"jsonlines\",\n    \"map\",\n    \"max\",\n    \"range\",\n    \"reverse\",\n    \"select\",\n    \"sort\",\n    \"str\",\n    \"sum\",\n    \"tail\",\n];"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/src/check/mod.rs\n===================================================================\n--- /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/src/check/mod.rs\n+++ /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/src/check/mod.rs\n@@ -574,13 +574,13 @@\n }\n \n /// Every function name the language itself provides, and therefore reserves. `str`, `range`,\n /// `chars`, and `i64` live in `builtin()`'s fixed table; `jsonlines`, `length`, `flatten`,\n-/// `tail`, `collect`, `fields`, `sort`, `reverse`, `sum`, and `max` are polymorphic and checked\n-/// from `synth`'s own arms; `select` and `map` rebind `.`. All sixteen are reserved the same\n-/// way, and the docs harness (tests/docs.rs) reads this list to insist each one has a\n-/// reference page.\n-pub const BUILTIN_NAMES: [&str; 16] = [\n+/// `tail`, `collect`, `fields`, `sort`, `reverse`, `sum`, `max`, `first`, `any`, and `all` are\n+/// polymorphic and checked from `synth`'s own arms; `select` and `map` rebind `.`. All nineteen\n+/// are reserved the same way, and the docs harness (tests/docs.rs) reads this list to insist each\n+/// one has a reference page.\n+pub const BUILTIN_NAMES: [&str; 19] = [\n     \"chars\",\n     \"collect\",\n     \"length\",\n     \"fields\",\n@@ -595,8 +595,11 @@\n     \"sort\",\n     \"str\",\n     \"sum\",\n     \"tail\",\n+    \"first\",\n+    \"any\",\n+    \"all\",\n ];\n \n /// Functions the language provides. Unary like every other function, so they need no special\n /// call syntax and are looked up before user definitions.\n","filediff":{"file":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/src/check/mod.rs","patch":"Index: /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/src/check/mod.rs\n===================================================================\n--- /home/kantord/.local