{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788460400858,"sessionID":"ses_f977bc931ffe9OHrIOJvOWQPwa","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-911232fe90e4366d","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/src/tags.rs","newString":"        Builtin::Sum => \"sum\",\n        Builtin::Max => \"max\",\n        Builtin::First => \"first\",\n        Builtin::Any => \"any\",\n        Builtin::All => \"all\",\n    }\n}","oldString":"        Builtin::Sum => \"sum\",\n        Builtin::Max => \"max\",\n    }\n}"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/src/tags.rs\n===================================================================\n--- /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/src/tags.rs\n+++ /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/src/tags.rs\n@@ -179,6 +179,9 @@\n         Builtin::Sort => \"sort\",\n         Builtin::Reverse => \"reverse\",\n         Builtin::Sum => \"sum\",\n         Builtin::Max => \"max\",\n+        Builtin::First => \"first\",\n+        Builtin::Any => \"any\",\n+        Builtin::All => \"all\",\n     }\n }\n","filediff":{"file":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/src/tags.rs","patch":"Index: /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/src/tags.rs\n===================================================================\n--- /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/src/tags.rs\n+++ /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/src/tags.rs\n@@ -179,6 +179,9 @@\n         Builtin::Sort => \"sort\",\n         Builtin::Reverse => \"reverse\",\n         Builtin::Sum => \"sum\",\n         Builtin::Max => \"max\",\n+        Builtin::First => \"first\",\n+        Builtin::Any => \"any\",\n+        Builtin::All => \"all\",\n     }\n }\n","additions":3,"deletions":0},"truncated":false},"title":"src/tags.rs","time":{"start":1788460400853,"end":1788460400856}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Wait, the `first_call` uses `arg.ty.elem()` which is `Type::elem` -- Vec-only (returns `Some` only for `Type::Vec`). Good, that means a Stream is refused. But the error message says \"needs a Vec\" which is correct.\n\nBut wait, `max_call` uses `arg.ty.elem()` and the error says \"needs a Vec of Int or Int64\". For `first`, the error should say \"needs a Vec\". Good.\n\nNow, there's a subtlety with `first_call` and `expect`/`synth` -- `first` returns `Opt<T>`. But what about the position -- can `first` be in an `expect` position where `Opt<T>` is wanted? The general `expect_inner` would synthesise and compare. Since `first_call` is dispatched from `call()` which is reached from both `synth` and `expect` paths... actually let me check. `call()` is called from `synth_inner`'s `Expr::Call` arm. And `expect_inner` doesn't have a special case for `first`/`any`/`all`, so it falls through to `synth`. That means `first(map(...))` in a position expecting `Opt<T>` would synthesise `first` (returning `Opt<T>`), then compare. Fine.\n\nBut wait -- there's a subtlety with `max_call` and `want`. Let me check: `max_call` doesn't take a `want` parameter and always returns `opt_of(ctx, elem)`. And it's only called from `call()` (synth path). For `expect` positions wanting `Opt<Int>`, `max(v)` synthesises `Opt<Int>` and the comparison passes. Good. Same for `first`.\n\nHmm, but actually there's a subtle issue: could `first` benefit from a `want` to type a literal element? Like `first([1, 2, 3])` -- the Vec literal synthesises fine. No issue. `first` is polymorphic over any element type, no constraint. Good.\n\nNow, one concern: the `first_call` returns `Opt<T>` where T is the element. But what if the Vec is `Vec<Str>` -- fine, returns `Opt<Str>`. What about `Vec<Record>`? Returns `Opt<Record>`. Good, polymorphic.\n\nNow let me update the tags.rs.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_0688bfddd001lBQpy4r73Lx7V6","sessionID":"ses_f977bc931ffe9OHrIOJvOWQPwa","messageID":"msg_0688bdf93001P4Jmo1xMdY2ZfE"}}
