nkwell would error).\n\nHmm. Let me check how `vec_sum` (returns i64, type `Int` = i64) flows -- `Int` is i64 so no mismatch. But `Any` returns `Bool` = i1, and the C function returns i64. So I need to truncate the i64 result to i1.\n\nLet me look at how the `call_rt` result is used and whether I should truncate. Let me look at `call_rt`.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_0688eef90001VG1p7bN523MBVf","sessionID":"ses_f977bc931ffe9OHrIOJvOWQPwa","messageID":"msg_0688edac4001ncQFrll5EZvKEz"}}
