{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788460635461,"sessionID":"ses_f977bc931ffe9OHrIOJvOWQPwa","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-aa1a00c28401e113","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/runtime/toylang.c","limit":15,"offset":1204},"output":"<path>/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/runtime/toylang.c</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1204: /* `max` over a Vec of Int or Int64: the greatest raw slot, Int's already sign-extended so the\n1205:  * i64 comparison orders it correctly. NULL on an empty Vec, the same absence encoding\n1206:  * tl_opt_some uses everywhere else, so a caller unwraps it the way it unwraps an Index result. */\n1207: int64_t *tl_vec_max(const tl_vec *v) {\n1208:     if (v->len == 0) {\n1209:         return NULL;\n1210:     }\n1211:     int64_t m = v->cols[0][0];\n1212:     for (int64_t i = 1; i < v->len; i++) {\n1213:         if (v->cols[0][i] > m) {\n1214:             m = v->cols[0][i];\n1215:         }\n1216:     }\n1217:     return tl_opt_some(m);\n1218: }\n\n(Showing lines 1204-1218 of 1373. Use offset=1219 to continue.)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"/* `max` over a Vec of Int or Int64: the greatest raw slot, Int's already sign-extended so the\n * i64 comparison orders it correctly. NULL on an empty Vec, the same absence encoding\n * tl_opt_some uses everywhere else, so a caller unwraps it the way it unwraps an Index result. */\nint64_t *tl_vec_max(const tl_vec *v) {\n    if (v->len == 0) {\n        return NULL;\n    }\n    int64_t m = v->cols[0][0];\n    for (int64_t i = 1; i < v->len; i++) {\n        if (v->cols[0][i] > m) {\n            m = v->cols[0][i];\n        }\n    }\n    return tl_opt_some(m);\n}","truncated":true,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/runtime/toylang.c","text":"/* `max` over a Vec of Int or Int64: the greatest raw slot, Int's already sign-extended so the\n * i64 comparison orders it correctly. NULL on an empty Vec, the same absence encoding\n * tl_opt_some uses everywhere else, so a caller unwraps it the way it unwraps an Index result. */\nint64_t *tl_vec_max(const tl_vec *v) {\n    if (v->len == 0) {\n        return NULL;\n    }\n    int64_t m = v->cols[0][0];\n    for (int64_t i = 1; i < v->len; i++) {\n        if (v->cols[0][i] > m) {\n            m = v->cols[0][i];\n        }\n    }\n    return tl_opt_some(m);\n}","lineStart":1204,"lineEnd":1218,"totalLines":1373,"truncated":true}},"title":"runtime/toylang.c","time":{"start":1788460635456,"end":1788460635460}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Now add the C runtime functions. Let me add `tl_vec_first`, `tl_vec_any`, `tl_vec_all` after `tl_vec_max` in runtime/toylang.c. Let me read the area around `tl_vec_max` and the `tl_at` to know the helpers available (`tl_opt_some`, `tl_rec_from_vec`).","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_0688f945a001VDhyT7LWsFvStK","sessionID":"ses_f977bc931ffe9OHrIOJvOWQPwa","messageID":"msg_0688f81a900155KgYatGHlq7KZ"}}
