equence ends it. Wait, `{\"some\": ...}` contains `\"some\"` but not `\"#`. The terminator is `\"#` (quote-hash). Inside, `\"some\"` has `\"s` not `\"#`, so it's fine. But `return {\"some\": max(v)}` -- the `\"` followed by `s` is fine. Hmm.\n\nWait, the error is about my NEW `FIRST_HELPER`. Let me look at what I wrote:\n```rust\nconst FIRST_HELPER: &str = r#\"def tl_first(v):\n    if len(v) == 0:\n        return \"none\"\n    return {\"some\": v[0]}\n\"#;\n```\nWait, I added a comment line BEFORE the const:\n```rust\n# The cut operator (gh:142): ...\nconst FIRST_HELPER: &str = r#\"...\"#;\n```\nNo wait, I wrote it as a Rust comment `//`? Let me re-check what I wrote. I wrote:\n```rust\n# The cut operator (gh:142): a reified search is a Vec, and `first` commits to the first answer.\n# An empty Vec has no first, so the absent Opt is tagged the way `tl_max` tags it.\nconst FIRST_HELPER: &str = r#\"def tl_first(v):\n...\n```\nI used `#` instead of `//` for the Rust comment! That's the bug. In Rust, comments are `//`, not `#`. The `#` is the raw-string terminator/attribute syntax. So I accidentally wrote `#` comments which Rust tries to parse as `#` (which is the raw-string delimiter or attribute). Let me fix -- use `//` comments. Actually wait, looking at the existing code, the `MAX_HELPER` has a `//` comment above it? Let me check -- the `MAX_HELPER` in py:\n```rust\nconst MAX_HELPER: &str = r#\"def tl_max(v):\n    if len(v) == 0:\n        return \"none\"\n    return {\"some\": max(v)}\n\"#;\n```\nThere's no `//` comment above it in py. But in the lua and go I used `//` comments. Let me check what I wrote in py -- I wrote `#` which is wrong. Let me fix to `//`.\n\nWait, actually I need to re-read my edit. I wrote:\n```\n# The cut operator (gh:142): a reified search is a Vec, and `first` commits to the first answer.\n# An empty Vec has no first, so the absent Opt is tagged the way `tl_max` tags it.\nconst FIRST_HELPER: &str = r#\"def tl_first(v):\n```\nYes, `#` is wrong. Should be `//`. Let me fix.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_068902b1e001UphmVMHk105mA9","sessionID":"ses_f977bc931ffe9OHrIOJvOWQPwa","messageID":"msg_0688fffc80010piAt2k94Wh94O"}}
