{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788460807718,"sessionID":"ses_f977bc931ffe9OHrIOJvOWQPwa","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-a6913e65900a3fd3","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# any\n\n`any(v)`, of type `Vec<Bool> -> Bool`: true if any element of `v` is true; an empty `Vec` is\nfalse. The existential cut of the query-is-search model (draft.md#query-is-search, gh:142): a\n`Vec<Bool>` is a reified search reduced to a mask, and `any` is whether the mask is set anywhere.\n\n```toylang\nany([3, 1, 4] | map(. >= 2))\n```\n\n```output\ntrue\n```\n\nAn empty `Vec<Bool>` is false -- nothing is set, so the existential cut is false:\n\n```toylang\nfn nothing() -> Vec<Int> = []\n\nany(nothing() | map(. >= 2))\n```\n\n```output\nfalse\n```\n\nA `Vec<Int>` is refused, since `any` reduces a mask rather than a value of any other type:\n\n```toylang\nany([1, 2])\n```\n\n```error\n`any` needs a Vec<Bool>, found Vec<Int> (at byte 4)\n```\n","filePath":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/docs/reference/builtins/any.md"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/docs/reference/builtins/any.md","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"docs/reference/builtins/any.md","time":{"start":1788460807705,"end":1788460807714}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_068922ed2001h3HDRpZD1zg63t","sessionID":"ses_f977bc931ffe9OHrIOJvOWQPwa","messageID":"msg_0689226e90010U1l77J3HKDzSN"}}
