{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788460811591,"sessionID":"ses_f977bc931ffe9OHrIOJvOWQPwa","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-b4f49a17c5a56446","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# all\n\n`all(v)`, of type `Vec<Bool> -> Bool`: true if every element of `v` is true; an empty `Vec` is\ntrue (vacuous -- the same answer a reduce starting from the identity gives). `any`'s dual, the\nuniversal cut of the query-is-search model (draft.md#query-is-search, gh:142).\n\n```toylang\nall([2, 3] | map(. >= 2))\n```\n\n```output\ntrue\n```\n\nOne false among trues is enough:\n\n```toylang\nall([3, 1, 4] | map(. >= 2))\n```\n\n```output\nfalse\n```\n\nAn empty `Vec<Bool>` is true -- nothing is false, so the universal cut is vacuously true:\n\n```toylang\nfn nothing() -> Vec<Int> = []\n\nall(nothing() | map(. >= 2))\n```\n\n```output\ntrue\n```\n","filePath":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/docs/reference/builtins/all.md"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-search-layer-build/docs/reference/builtins/all.md","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"docs/reference/builtins/all.md","time":{"start":1788460811580,"end":1788460811588}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_068923f76001IRjZrZn8m4HFlN","sessionID":"ses_f977bc931ffe9OHrIOJvOWQPwa","messageID":"msg_06892373e001cHZFJITZQiaxXS"}}
